Name: HarfBuzz & Google Fontations (Skrifa / Read-Fonts)
Short Name: harfbuzz
URL: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz.git
Version: 10.2.0
Revision: chrome/m156
License: MIT
License File: COPYING
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
OpenType text shaping engine paired with Google's memory-safe Rust Fontations stack
(`skrifa = 0.44`, `read-fonts = 0.41`, `cosmic-text = 0.14.2`, `swash = 0.2.0`) used in
Chromium M156+, `yolo-gpu`, `anyrender_skia`, and `obscura-render`.

Local Modifications:
Aligned across `yolo-ui` and `yolo-web` via `yolo cvm`.
